      {
        "start": 436,
        "end": 878,
        "quote": "The current clinician's recorded hearing assessment finds no hearing loss after examining the driver in suitable conditions, although yesterday's radio conversation was difficult when the cab speaker crackled and the windows were open; a colleague who uses hearing aids is mentioned in the same discussion, but those aids belong to the colleague, and an undated employer checklist is not used to replace today's completed clinical assessment.",
